1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Nearly 1 in 3 people say a fake voice called them.

2
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:04,710
Picture it.

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:05,750
Your phone rings.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,200
It says "Mom."

5
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,420
She's crying.

6
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,470
She needs money. NOW.

7
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:12,310
Her voice works like a key.

8
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,190
You hear it...

9
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,510
and the door opens.

10
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,910
Copying a key?

11
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,470
You just need a good look at it.

12
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:20,790
The app I use for this voice says 30 seconds can be enough.

13
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,110
One voice note.

14
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,180
Yes.

15
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,300
This voice is a copy of mine.

16
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,980
And now the key-cutting machines are for sale.

17
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,760
A security firm watched criminal chat groups.

18
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:34,290
Voice-cloning trade grew over 7 times in 2 years.

19
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:36,560
Stolen accounts on real cloning apps?

20
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,140
From about $10.

21
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,040
The twist?

22
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,020
What these criminals talk about most... isn't Mom.

23
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,140
It's your bank.

24
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,090
A fake bank line calls and asks for your code.

25
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,070
That code is your second lock.

26
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,690
Read it out, and they're in.

27
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:50,490
The catch?

28
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,210
These numbers come from companies that sell protection.

29
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:56,090
They count posts and reports, not stolen money.

30
00:00:56,090 --> 00:00:58,740
So add 2 locks no copy can open.

31
00:00:58,740 --> 00:00:59,360
One.

32
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:02,240
A family safe word, agreed face to face.

33
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:02,860
Two.

34
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,850
Your code never leaves your phone.

35
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:06,390
A real bank won't ask.

36
00:01:06,390 --> 00:01:08,430
Hang up, and call a number you know.

37
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:09,720
Now your phone rings.

38
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,490
"Mom."

39
00:01:10,490 --> 00:01:11,710
You ask for the word.

40
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:14,710
There's one word in this video I never said out loud.

41
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:15,480
Spotted it?

42
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,280
Comment it.

43
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:19,300
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
